    "https://my.corehr.com/pls/esbshedkitrecruit/erq_jobspec_version_4.jobspec?p_id=016283": {
      "title": "Assistant Lecturer in Social Care #IJ",
      "description": "Assistant Lecturer in Social Care #IJ Vacancy Description : The School of Business and Humanities wishes to recruit an Assistant Lecturer in Social Care. The post will be located within the Department of Humanities. The role will involve supporting the Honours Social Care degree programme and includes responsibility for lecturing, placement supervision and assessment. Qualifications and Requirement: Successful applicants must: - Currently be a qualified and recognised Social Care Practitioner/Lecturer. - Be registered with SCWRB at CORU, as a Social Care Worker - Hold a relevant Honours Degree (First or Second Class) in Social Care. - Hold a relevant Social Care postgraduate qualification ideally at Masters or PhD level. - Have at least three years post qualification experience in a professional social care environment. - Have a minimum of three years’ teaching experience at third-level - Have a minimum of three years’ academic research experience at third-level and a record of peer-reviewed publication and research supervision Job Title : Assistant Lecturer Vacancy ID : 016283 Vacancy Type : Academic"
    },
